is benefit against all of them. You can't move a target that's being ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grabbed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grabbed"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grappled"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grappled"},", and you can't move a target into a solid object or into another creature's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fighting Space"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fighting_Space","referenceId":"reference:cdbf34043baceb78"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
